'll keep walking aheadComment: 0,0:01:08.58,0:01:11.06,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Saa yukouComment: 0,0:01:08.58,0:01:11.06,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,さぁ行｜ゆこうComment: 0,0:01:08.58,0:01:11.06,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,So let's goComment: 0,0:01:11.06,0:01:14.27,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Tachidomaru koto nakuComment: 0,0:01:11.06,0:01:14.27,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,立｜たち止｜どまることなくComment: 0,0:01:11.06,0:01:14.27,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Without stoppingComment: 0,0:01:14.27,0:01:19.51,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Nagareru toki ni makenai youniComment: 0,0:01:14.27,0:01:19.51,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,流｜な#｜がれる時｜と#｜きに負｜まけないようにComment: 0,0:01:14.27,0:01:19.51,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Without giving up to the flow of timeComment: 0,0:01:19.51,0:01:25.12,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Nando mo tachimukai tsuzukeyouComment: 0,0:01:19.51,0:01:25.12,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,何｜なん度｜!ども立｜たち向｜むかい続｜つ#｜づけようComment: 0,0:01:19.51,0:01:25.12,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,I'll keep getting back upComment: 0,0:01:25.13,0:01:30.76,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Taisetsu na mono ushinaitakunai karaComment: 0,0:01:25.13,0:01:30.76,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,大｜た#｜い切｜!せ#｜つなもの失｜<う#｜し#｜ないたくないからComment: 0,0:01:25.13,0:01:30.76,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Because I don't want to lose something preciousComment: 0,0:01:30.77,0:01:35.88,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Boku no naka ni nagareru koe waComment: 0,0:01:30.77,0:01:35.88,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,僕｜ぼ#｜くの中｜な#｜かに流｜な#｜がれる声｜こ#｜えはComment: 0,0:01:30.77,0:01:35.88,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,The voice inside of meComment: 0,0:01:35.89,0:01:41.28,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Zutto zutto boku wo sasaeteruComment: 0,0:01:35.89,0:01:41.28,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,ずっとずっと僕｜ぼ#｜くを支｜さ#｜さえてるComment: 0,0:01:35.89,0:01:41.28,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,keeps sustaining meComment: 0,0:01:41.28,0:01:46.41,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,ITAZURA na ame ga jama suru kedoComment: 0,0:01:41.28,0:01:46.41,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,イタズラな雨｜あ#｜めが邪｜じゃ魔｜!まするけどComment: 0,0:01:41.28,0:01:46.41,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Wicked rain will get in my wayComment: 0,0:0