0,0,0,fx,さDialogue: 0,0:02:19.05,0:02:20.45,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,kiDialogue: 0,0:02:19.05,0:02:20.45,Kanji-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,きDialogue: 0,0:02:19.36,0:02:20.76,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,heDialogue: 0,0:02:19.36,0:02:20.76,Kanji,,0,0,0,fx,へDialogue: 0,0:02:19.71,0:02:21.11,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,to...Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.71,0:02:21.11,Kanji,,0,0,0,fx,と...Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.70,0:02:37.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Why did the video cut out?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.34,0:02:39.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Show us Marineford!Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.02,0:02:40.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry and show it already!Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.54,0:02:45.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Something must have happened to their Visual Transponder Snails, there's nothing we can do!Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.58,0:02:49.35,Main,,0,0,0,,The Navy and Whitebeard made a deal? Can it be true?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.42,0:02:53.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Show us something!Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.10,0:02:56.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Did Whitebeard really sell out his companions?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.09,0:03:01.06,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on in this war?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.83,0:03:05.86,Main,,0,0,0,,What will happen to the world?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.67,0:03:18.33,Main,,0,0,0,,What an annoying move by the Navy...Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.33,0:03:20.68,Main,,0,0,0,,I guess the show's over, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.68,0:03:24.38,Main,,0,0,0,,We sailed back here just so we could watch the war...Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.38,0:03:26.16,Main,,0,0,0,,now they're having trouble with the Visual Transponder Snails?Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.16,0:03:28.19,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no way that's the truth.Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.19,0:03:29.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? It's not?Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.72,0:03:34.69,Main,,0,0,0,,You sure are an idiot. It's obvious that they're hiding something.Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.69,0:03:37.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Something they don't want pirates, or anyone else, to see...Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.64,0:03:49.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain Bonney...Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.79,0:03:51.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Leave me alone!Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.91,0:03:54.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard sold out his companions?Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.60,0:04:00.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Like hell. He's a legend because he never does anything like that.Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.19,0:04:05.42,Title,,0,0,0,,AssaultDialogue: 0,0:04:00.50,0:04:01.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Time to set sail, Bepo.Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.88,0:04:03.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Aye aye, Captain!Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.52,0:04:05.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Come with me, Jean Bart!Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.42,0:04:08.76,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right. It doesn't look like it'll be fixed anytime soon.Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.76,0:04:12.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Right now, there's no way to tell what's happening in Marineford.Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.74,0:04:19.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Meteor Volcano!Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.45,0:04:33.82,Main,,0,0,0,,We're not letting you escape!Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.82,0:04:37.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Melt the ice and take away their footing!Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.91,0:04:49.01,Main,,0,0,0,,T-The water...Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.54,0:04:51.34,Main,,0,0,0,,It's hot!Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.34,0:04:53.57,Main,,0,0,0,,The magma is making the water boil!Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.11,0:04:57.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Get out of the water, quickly!Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.98,0:05:00.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.31,0:05:13.13,Main,,0,0,0,,This way is blocked too!Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.70,0:05:20.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Is there nothing we can do against this wall?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.70,0:05:42.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard...Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.62,0:05:49.90,Main,,0,0,0,,T-The Pops's attacks aren't working... That's no ordinary wall!Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.80,0:05:54.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, it's time to end this.Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.31,0:06:05.13,Main,,0,0,0,,The Moby Dick took a direct hit from the magma!Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.13,0:06:06.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Put out the fire!Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.85,0:06:08.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry!Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.25,0:06:11.02,Main,,0,0,0,,You have to hold on!Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.75,0:06:15.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't let the ship sink!Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.20,0:06:19.49,Main,,0,0,0,,We're gonna travel the seas with our friends, and Ace, once more!Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.49,0:06:23.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard. Your era is at an end!Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.51,0:06:41.75,Main,,0,0,0,,The Moby Dick...Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.23,0:06:46.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Damn the Navy!Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.47,0:06:49.25,Main,,0,0,0,,That was our pride and joy!Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.59,0:06:56.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn! They destroyed our ship! The ship that's carried the Whitebeard Pirates for decades!Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.71,0:07:15.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.32,0:07:23.66,Main,,0,0,0,,We're losing our only way into the plaza!Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.06,0:07:27.04,Main,,0,0,0,,The plan is progressing smoothly.Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.04,0:07:32.56,Main,,0,0,0,,The execution of Portgas D. Ace... will proceed...Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.56,0:07:35.10,Main,,0,0,0,,immediately!Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.95,0:07:51.75,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't even see what's going on!Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.75,0:07:54.05,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no way we'll let them kill Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.05,0:07:55.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah...Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.54,0:07:57.44,Main,,0,0,0,,There's still one way...Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.44,0:07:59.16,Main,,0,0,0,,One single path...Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.86,0:08:02.20,Main,,0,0,0,,The path that Oars made for us!Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.33,0:08:07.43,Main,,0,0,0,,If we go that way, we'll be killed. The Navy is sure to be waiting for us.Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.33,0:08:11.68,Main,,0,0,0,,This is no time to stand around and chat!Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.68,0:08:15.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah... If we're gonna save Ace, that's the only way...Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.12,0:08:37.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.10,0:08:45.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat...Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.50,0:08:47.26,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll go, too!Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.26,0:08:51.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.20,0:09:00.39,Main,,0,0,0,,That route is far too obvious!Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.39,0:09:04.20,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not over yet! Hold them off as best as you can!Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.20,0:09:05.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire!Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.40,0:09:14.96,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no way the enemy would ignore the only opening!Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.96,0:09:16.23,Main,,0,0,0,,It's definitely a trap!Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.20,0:09:20.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire!Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.34,0:09:27.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat-boy!Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.02,0:09:27.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.40,0:09:58.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Little Oars Jr.! He was still alive?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.14,0:10:01.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace... kun...Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.41,0:10:03.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Oars...Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.82,0:10:08.56,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm... gonna protect... Ace-kun...Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.56,0:10:10.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Oars!Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.19,0:10:17.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain Squard!Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.53,0:10:20.11,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys...Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.03,0:10:26.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Right!Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.74,0:10:32.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you alright, Luffy-kun?Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.01,0:10:34.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Really, how reckless can vyou get?Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.04,0:10:39.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Prepare to fire.Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.22,0:10:46.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Shoot!Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.83,0:10:50.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Oars!Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.80,0:10:54.07,Main,,0,0,0,,I've gotta do something...Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.07,0:10:55.95,Main,,0,0,0,,I've gotta hurry...Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.95,0:10:59.37,Main,,0,0,0,,They're gonna execute Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.37,0:11:01.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, we must act quickly!Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.97,0:11:03.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.30,0:11:08.56,Main,,0,0,0,,I've got...Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.56,0:11:10.98,Main,,0,0,0,,a favor to ask!Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.98,0:11:13.25,Main,,0,0,0,,You sure are persistent...Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.25,0:11:15.52,Main,,0,0,0,,He's already half-dead! Finish him off!Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.75,0:11:19.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't bother. I'll do it.Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.78,0:11:21.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Kizaru-san!Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.23,0:11:26.23,Main,,0,0,0,,We need to get the execution over with, and fast.Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.03,0:11:33.77,Main,,0,0,0,,At times like this, it's best to just pierce them right through the head...Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.77,0:11:38.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Ocean Current Shoulder Throw!Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.74,0:12:07.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Lu-Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.32,0:12:10.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.52,0:12:21.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, my. You finally made it here.Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.29,0:12:27.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Quite an entrance, son of Dragon.Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.33,0:12:33.03,Main,,0,0,0,,This youngster sure is scary...Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.37,0:12:43.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace's little brother just went straight over the wall!Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.72,0:12:44.91,Main,,0,0,0,,That kid...Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.15,0:12:53.92,Main,,0,0,0,,If nothing else, I praise your tenacity.Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.92,0:12:58.82,Main,,0,0,0,,But you're not ready for this stage yet.Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.82,0:13:01.99,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no way you can beat us, you know?Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.13,0:13:12.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Give Ace...Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.64,0:13:17.48,Main,,0,0,0,,back!Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.71,0:13:22.01,Main,,0,0,0,,He's just as reckless as his brother.Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.26,0:13:24.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Oars! Stay where you are.Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.65,0:13:27.02,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll need your strength.Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.02,0:13:27.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Pops...Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.18,0:13:29.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Jozu! Time for our trump card!Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.63,0:13:30.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Sure!Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.39,0:13:32.59,Main,,0,0,0,,All men, prepare yourselves!Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.59,0:13:35.03,Main,,0,0,0,,We're breaking into the plaza!Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.90,0:13:42.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber-Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.23,0:13:45.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Stamp Gatling!Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.81,0:14:25.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Gear Second!Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.28,0:14:32.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to fight these guys!Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.62,0:14:35.72,Main,,0,0,0,,How cunning of him.Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.53,0:14:44.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Too slow.Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.71,0:14:58.27,Main,,0,0,0,,On my mark!Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.27,0:14:59.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.15,0:15:06.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Do it!Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.07,0:15:28.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace!!Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.78,0:15:47.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Who was that?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.96,0:15:54.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.00,0:16:02.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Considering your old grudge against Whitebeard, I had thought we were lucky...Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.22,0:16:05.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Crocodile!Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.64,0:16:10.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Him!Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.86,0:16:16.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh... it wasn't my turn yet?Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.58,0:16:23.19,Main,,0,0,0,,You were hell-bent on killing the Pops.  What's this sudden change of heart?Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.16,0:16:30.07,Main,,0,0,0,,That dying old man?Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.07,0:16:32.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll eliminate him later.Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.68,0:16:35.64,Main,,0,0,0,,But right now...Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.64,0:16:40.11,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't want to see you enjoying victory!Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.82,0:16:55.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey now, Crocodile-man!Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.62,0:16:57.47,Main,,0,0,0,,D-Doflamingo!Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.47,0:17:01.17,Main,,0,0,0,,So you're ditching me to team up with Whitebeard?Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.88,0:17:09.87,Main,,0,0,0,,It's enough to make a guy jealous, ya know...Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.00,0:17:15.91,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't team up with anybody.Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.44,0:17:21.55,Main,,0,0,0,,That's the same as brushing me off.Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.55,0:17:23.49,Main,,0,0,0,,More or less.Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.84,0:17:42.47,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't get what's going on... but we were saved.Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.82,0:17:45.41,Main,,0,0,0,,End of the line, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.04,0:17:47.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Die!Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.12,0:17:59.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Get out of...Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.82,0:18:03.39,Main,,0,0,0,,my way!Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.60,0:18:14.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop right there, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.88,0:18:16.61,Main,,0,0,0,,I will not let you go any further!Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.61,0:18:18.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Move it!Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.40,0:18:17.90,Secondary,,0,0,0,,Shave!Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.55,0:18:20.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Moon Walk!Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.38,0:18:23.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Iron Body...Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.78,0:18:24.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Smash!Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.54,0:18:33.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber-Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.09,0:18:33.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Iron Body!Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.58,0:18:35.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Bullet!Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.48,0:18:45.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.67,0:18:47.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't let him get any closer!Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.86,0:18:51.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Admiral Sakazuki!Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.64,0:19:06.09,Main,,0,0,0,,That hurts!Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.09,0:19:07.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn it!Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.85,0:19:11.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm indebted to your granddad, but...Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.38,0:19:13.43,Main,,0,0,0,,I have no choice!Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.43,0:19:16.97,Main,,0,0,0,,You have chosen your own death!Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.97,0:19:20.14,Main,,0,0,0,,You! Do not lay a hand on Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.40,0:19:31.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Admiral!Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.26,0:19:33.92,Main,,0,0,0,,That's...Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.54,0:19:38.66,Main,,0,0,0,,The Commander of the First Division... Marco!Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.84,0:19:43.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks for saving me.Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.54,0:19:46.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it.Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.18,0:19:53.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Three people have penetrated the plaza!Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.01,0:19:56.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Devil Fruit users are passing over the walls!Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.82,0:20:04.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Cross the water and head for Oars!Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.32,0:20:09.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Whatever happens, get to the plaza!Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.46,0:20:13.26,Main,,0,0,0,,The pirates are getting desperate.Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.26,0:20:15.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Defend the gap in the walls!Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.18,0:20:16.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.10,0:20:23.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Even after losing their ships and their footing, they're still as frenzied as ever.Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.44,0:20:25.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Foolish pirates.Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.58,0:20:28.07,Main,,0,0,0,,They're sitting ducks! Fire!Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.20,0:21:26.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone, get on board!Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.92,0:21:28.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.60,0:21:31.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight!Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.36,0:21:34.14,Main,,0,0,0,,No way! A ship...Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.96,0:21:36.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Big trouble!Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.02,0:21:39.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Another coated ship has emerged from the bay!Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.10,0:21:45.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn it!Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.14,0:21:47.35,Main,,0,0,0,,It was hiding underwater the whole time!Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.11,0:22:12.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't remember saying that we'd used all of our ships!Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.25,0:22:21.32,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a paddle ship!Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.32,0:22:23.45,Main,,0,0,0,,It's going to ram us!Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.20,0:22:25.26,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.43,0:22:32.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Sink it! Just like the Moby Dick!Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.60,0:22:39.94,Main,,0,0,0,,No, not the ship!Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.94,0:22:41.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Shoot Oars!Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.84,0:22:43.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oars?Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.46,0:22:46.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Too late!Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.18,0:22:48.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Here we go, everyone!Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.42,0:23:05.64,Main,,0,0,0,,H-He pulled the whole ship in!Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.64,0:23:09.20,Main,,0,0,0,,The intruders have breached the walls!Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.11,0:23:20.97,Main,,0,0,0,,We're in the plaza!Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.97,0:23:24.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's save Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.68,0:23:27.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Time to overthrow Navy HQ!Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.75,0:23:31.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.08,0:23:33.74,Main,,0,0,0,,They got us.Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.74,0:23:39.23,Main,,0,0,0,,There was one tiny mouse hole in the walls, and they swarmed right in.Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.02,0:23:44.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Those walls may wind up working against us.Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.65,0:23:47.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Pops!Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.70,0:23:50.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard...Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.18,0:23:54.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Still got your head, Ace?Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.70,0:24:00.38,Main,,0,0,0,,We made it!Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.38,0:24:05.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Now Ace-kun can be resc-Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.23,0:24:10.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Oars!Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.62,0:24:20.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Save... Ace-kun...Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.04,0:24:36.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Oars...Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.40,0:25:27.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard has entered the plaza!Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.08,0:25:37.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Stand back, my sons.Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.86,0:26:11.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Men!Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.87,0:26:18.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Rescue Ace, and destroy the Navy!Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.96,0:26:26.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Garp...Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.96,0:26:28.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.36,0:26:38.04,Main,,0,0,0,,It looks like even we have to take a hand in this!